# Each published file's uncovered regions, uncovered branch sides, and copies
# no test ran of functions that ran, across every tier coverage.yml measures,
# as `admin/coverage-gate check` counts them. A file whose counts rise past
# these fails the nightly; when tests cover more, lower them to the run's
# `coverage.baseline` artifact. A file not listed has none. The regions and
# branches of rind's backends, `rind/src/low/`, are not counted: which run
# depends on the CPU the hosted runner draws and on thread races.

